{"id":"0a420354d028a2dd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/609_条件逻辑_CK+ID.md","title":"609 条件逻辑 CK+ID","display":"609_条件逻辑_CK+ID","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}\\)</span>，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{609}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{609}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{609}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{609}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{609}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{609}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{609}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{609}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{609}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,609}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,609}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{609}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{609}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{609}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{609}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{609}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{609}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CK 条件分配：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>ID 公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{609}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{609}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{609}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{609}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{609}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{609}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{609}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{609}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>。允许行：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假设行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>公理行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{609}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{609}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>MP 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>RCK 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{609}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{609}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{609}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{609}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{609}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{609}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。证明前缀闭包给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{609}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{609}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{609}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{609}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{609}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{609}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{609}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{609}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{609}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{609}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-选择函数语义\">8. 选择函数语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"609\">\\(609\\)</span>-选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID}\">\\(\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，并满足 ID 约束</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq W\">\\(X\\subseteq W\\)</span> 成立。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{609}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{609}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{609}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{609}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统在 CK 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{609}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{609}\\)</span> 上精确加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{609}\\)</span>；不加入 CEM、中心性或 Lewis 反事实公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>ID 是公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\Rightarrow A\\}\">\\(\\{A\\Rightarrow A\\}\\)</span>，不是名称占位；每个公式实例均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\)</span> 的构造闭包给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CKID}_{609}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\operatorname{FV}_{609},\\operatorname{BV}_{609},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{609},\\operatorname{Sub}_{609},\\equiv_{\\alpha,609},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{609},\\mathsf{Rule}_{609},\\mathsf{Proof}_{609},\\operatorname{last}_{609},\n\\vdash_{609},\\mathsf{Thm}_{609},\\mathsf{Cert}_{609},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{609},\\Vdash_{609},\\models_{609}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CKID}_{609}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\operatorname{FV}_{609},\\operatorname{BV}_{609},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{609},\\operatorname{Sub}_{609},\\equiv_{\\alpha,609},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{609},\\mathsf{Rule}_{609},\\mathsf{Proof}_{609},\\operatorname{last}_{609},\n\\vdash_{609},\\mathsf{Thm}_{609},\\mathsf{Cert}_{609},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{609}^{ID},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{609},\\Vdash_{609},\\models_{609}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含条件句法演算、ID 选择函数模型、满足关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或模型论定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-选择函数语义","text":"8. 选择函数语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{609}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}